                        "entry_id": "8e1543ee-79ad-39d0-a6f4-b50dde9e3c53",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any method of achieving a goal by means of a series of gradual increments, or small steps."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "44d2859e-8b03-4330-9087-bb4196459141",
                                "sense_id": "a3d54196-e61e-365c-bbde-3cbbafab6607",
                                "text": "We don’t want to scare away our members or provoke a fight with the government. So the only realistic approach is incrementalism. We will campaign, issue by issue, sector by sector, for gradual improvements. […] The problem was never that system change is too big an ask or takes too long. The problem is that incrementalism is too small an ask."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0dbc7d3-7d4f-4b8d-a5ab-7a994bf39be1",
                                "sense_id": "a3d54196-e61e-365c-bbde-3cbbafab6607",
                                "text": "And after a summer of extreme heat and wild weather, she evidently worries that incrementalism will not be enough to address a climate crisis that is crying out for revolution."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
